\@writefile{toc}{\contentsline {subsection}{\numberline {3.1}Architecture}{6}{subsection.3.1}\protected@file@percent }
\citation{liu2022pykt}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces The diagram illustrates the functional layers of the gTransformer Architecture: (1) \textit  {Input Layer}: data enriched with BKT reference data ($p_{BKT}$ and theoretical parameters); (2) \textit  {Embeddings}: provides the foundational material through individualized transformations ($x', y'$); (3) \textit  {Attention Heads}: encoder-decoder transformer synthesizes history and task into a contextualized representation ($z_t$); (4) \textit  {Prediction Head and Grounded Read-out}: provide performance probabilities ($p_{pred}$) from historical context and grounded pedagogical diagnostics ($p_{know}, p_{rate}$) from representational grounding; (5) \textit  {Loss Functions}: implement a multi-objective pipeline ($\mathcal  {L}_{sup}, \mathcal  {L}_{int}$) to ensure semantic alignment; and (6) \textit  {Diagnostic Probing Validation}: verifies the structural preservation of pedagogical constructs through linear probing of internal representations.\relax }}{7}{figure.caption.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{gtransformer_arch}{{2}{7}{The diagram illustrates the functional layers of the gTransformer Architecture: (1) \textit {Input Layer}: data enriched with BKT reference data ($p_{BKT}$ and theoretical parameters); (2) \textit {Embeddings}: provides the foundational material through individualized transformations ($x', y'$); (3) \textit {Attention Heads}: encoder-decoder transformer synthesizes history and task into a contextualized representation ($z_t$); (4) \textit {Prediction Head and Grounded Read-out}: provide performance probabilities ($p_{pred}$) from historical context and grounded pedagogical diagnostics ($p_{know}, p_{rate}$) from representational grounding; (5) \textit {Loss Functions}: implement a multi-objective pipeline ($\mathcal {L}_{sup}, \mathcal {L}_{int}$) to ensure semantic alignment; and (6) \textit {Diagnostic Probing Validation}: verifies the structural preservation of pedagogical constructs through linear probing of internal representations.\relax }{figure.caption.2}{}}
\newlabel{gtransformer_arch@cref}{{[figure][2][]2}{[1][7][]7}}
